 class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="6907f279-a86d-4b38-9501-17a9ba17b1ad" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="6907f279-a86d-4b38-9501-17a9ba17b1ad"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">कोई बात नहीं भाई। यह छोटी-सी गलती हो सकती है। घबराओ मत।</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Streamlit में Repository डालते समय सिर्फ <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">foodbus</code> नहीं डालना है।</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">तुम्हें इस फॉर्म में GitHub Repository का पूरा नाम चुनना होगा:</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">तुम्हारा-GitHub-Username/food-bus</code></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">उदाहरण के लिए अगर तुम्हारा GitHub Username <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">sanket123</code> है, तो:</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">sanket123/food-bus</code></p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">अभी ये चेक करो</h2><ol class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">GitHub खोलो।</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">अपनी <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">food-bus</code> Repository खोलो।</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">ऊपर Repository के नाम के पास तुम्हारा Username दिखेगा।</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Username और Repository का नाम देखकर Streamlit में सही Repository चुनो।</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">मुझे बस एक बात बताओ:</span> तुम्हारी GitHub Repository का नाम <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">food-bus</code> है या <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">foodbus</code>?</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">चाहो तो Streamlit पर जो Error आ रहा है उसका Screenshot भेज दो। मैं देखकर बताऊँगा कहाँ गलती है।</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:mt-3 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 browser:-ms-0.5 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-xs"><path d="M13.468 11.1216C13.468 10.4107 13.468 9.91717 13.4367 9.53369C13.4137 9.25191 13.3758 9.0622 13.3244 8.91846L13.2687 8.78858C13.1148 8.48652 12.8803 8.23344 12.593 8.05713L12.466 7.98584C12.308 7.90546 12.0963 7.84854 11.7209 7.81787C11.3374 7.78656 10.8439 7.78662 10.133 7.78662H7.29999C6.58895 7.78662 6.09562 7.78654 5.7121 7.81787C5.43015 7.84091 5.24064 7.87872 5.09686 7.93018L4.96698 7.98584C4.66487 8.13977 4.41184 8.37419 4.23554 8.66162L4.16522 8.78858C4.08477 8.94657 4.02794 9.15811 3.99725 9.53369C3.96594 9.91718 3.96503 10.4107 3.96503 11.1216V13.9546C3.96503 14.6656 3.96592 15.159 3.99725 15.5425C4.02796 15.9182 4.08471 16.1296 4.16522 16.2876L4.23554 16.4136C4.41185 16.7012 4.66472